# The matter content of the Standard Model, one generation of fermions, with their electric charges and color
# structure constructed and PROVEN rather than asserted. The gauge files build the FORCES (the U(1) x SU(2) x SU(3)
# carriers). This file builds the MATTER those forces act on.
#
# One generation has four fermion species: an up-type quark, a down-type quark, a charged lepton (the electron), and a
# neutrino. The quarks carry COLOR, so each comes in three copies, one for each of the three SU(3) colors red, green,
# and blue. The leptons are colorless (color singlets), one copy each. So a full generation is 3 + 3 + 1 + 1 = 8 charged
# states (twelve once the neutrino's color singlet and the antiparticles are counted, but here we track the four species
# and weight the quarks by their color multiplicity of three).
#
# ELECTRIC CHARGE is quantized in units of one-third the proton charge, so we measure charge as an INTEGER number of
# thirds. The up quark is +2 thirds (+2/3), the down quark is -1 third (-1/3), the electron is -3 thirds (-1), and the
# neutrino is 0. Every observed charge is an integer multiple of one-third, which holds here because every species charge
# is an integer in the thirds unit.
#
# The quarks bind into colorless HADRONS whose total charge is a whole number. A PROTON is two up quarks and one down,
# +2 + 2 - 1 = +3 thirds = +1 proton charge. A NEUTRON is one up and two downs, +2 - 1 - 1 = 0, electrically neutral.
# These integer hadron charges are exactly why matter is neutral in bulk.
#
# The deepest fact proven here is ANOMALY CANCELLATION. For the theory to be consistent the sum of electric charges over
# one full generation, counting each quark three times for its three colors, must vanish:
#   3 * (up) + 3 * (down) + (electron) + (neutrino)
#     = 3 * (+2) + 3 * (-1) + (-3) + 0 = 6 - 3 - 3 + 0 = 0.
# This remarkable balance between the quark and lepton charges is not an accident of the numbers. It is forced by gauge
# consistency, and it is what makes the Standard Model a well-defined quantum theory.
#
# Finally the pattern REPEATS exactly three times: there are three GENERATIONS (the electron, muon, and tau families),
# and the charge of a species does not depend on which generation it sits in. The up quark, the charm quark, and the top
# quark all carry +2 thirds.

load @term/seed/code/atom/flag
  find flag

# The opposite truth value: yes becomes no and back. Used to state that the quark and lepton tests are exact
# complements.
task flip-flag
  take f, like flag
  like flag
  fork case, read f
    case yes
      send back
        make no
    case no
      send back
        make yes

# THE FOUR FERMION SPECIES of one generation: the up-type quark, the down-type quark, the charged lepton (electron), and
# the neutrino. These are the carriers of the matter charges built below.
form particle
  case up-quark
  case down-quark
  case electron
  case neutrino

# THE THREE SU(3) COLORS carried by the quarks. Leptons are colorless and take no color value. The strong force acts on
# this triplet, rotating red, green, and blue into one another.
form color
  case red
  case green
  case blue

# THE THREE GENERATIONS. The matter pattern repeats three times: the electron family, the muon family, and the tau
# family. The forces and charges are identical across them, only the masses differ.
form generation
  case one
  case two
  case three

# ELECTRIC CHARGE in units of one-third the proton charge, a signed integer. Up is +2 thirds, down is -1 third, the
# electron is -3 thirds (a whole -1), and the neutrino is 0. This is the fundamental table the rest of the file proves
# laws about.
task charge
  take p, like particle
  like integer
  fork case, read p
    case up-quark
      send back
        code 2
    case down-quark
      send back
        code -1
    case electron
      send back
        code -3
    case neutrino
      send back
        code 0

# IS-QUARK: the up-type and down-type particles carry color and feel the strong force, so they are quarks. The electron
# and neutrino do not.
task is-quark
  take p, like particle
  like flag
  fork case, read p
    case up-quark
      send back
        make yes
    case down-quark
      send back
        make yes
    case electron
      send back
        make no
    case neutrino
      send back
        make no

# IS-LEPTON: the colorless particles, the electron and the neutrino. Exactly the complement of the quarks.
task is-lepton
  take p, like particle
  like flag
  fork case, read p
    case up-quark
      send back
        make no
    case down-quark
      send back
        make no
    case electron
      send back
        make yes
    case neutrino
      send back
        make yes

# COLOR MULTIPLICITY: how many copies of a species appear in one generation. A quark comes in three colors, so it counts
# three times. A lepton is a single color singlet, so it counts once. This is the weight used in the anomaly sum.
task color-count
  take p, like particle
  like integer
  fork case, read p
    case up-quark
      send back
        code 3
    case down-quark
      send back
        code 3
    case electron
      send back
        code 1
    case neutrino
      send back
        code 1

# THE COLOR-WEIGHTED CHARGE of a species: its charge times its color multiplicity. For a quark this is the total charge
# of all three colored copies, for a lepton it is just its charge. Summed over the four species this gives the generation
# charge total whose vanishing is the anomaly cancellation.
task weighted-charge
  take p, like particle
  like integer
  send back
    call multiply
      call color-count
        read p
      call charge
        read p

# EVERY SPECIES IS A QUARK OR A LEPTON, never both and never neither: is-quark p and is-lepton p are exact complements,
# so their disagreement is total. Proved by induction over all four species. This is the clean color split of the matter
# content.
rule every-particle-is-quark-or-lepton
  mark p, like particle
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call is-quark
        read p
      call flip-flag
        call is-lepton
          read p
  fold p

# CHARGE QUANTIZATION, the up sector: the up quark carries +2 thirds. Every charge in the model is an integer count of
# thirds, the unit of charge quantization, and this is one entry of that table proved by direct computation.
rule up-quark-charge-is-two-thirds
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call charge
        make up-quark
      code 2
  calm hold

# CHARGE QUANTIZATION, the down sector: the down quark carries -1 third.
rule down-quark-charge-is-minus-one-third
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call charge
        make down-quark
      code -1
  calm hold

# CHARGE QUANTIZATION, the charged lepton: the electron carries -3 thirds, a whole -1.
rule electron-charge-is-minus-three-thirds
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call charge
        make electron
      code -3
  calm hold

# CHARGE QUANTIZATION, the neutrino: it is electrically neutral, 0 thirds.
rule neutrino-charge-is-zero
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call charge
        make neutrino
      code 0
  calm hold

# COLOR MULTIPLICITY OF THE QUARKS: the up quark comes in three colors, so it is counted three times in a generation.
rule up-quark-has-three-colors
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call color-count
        make up-quark
      code 3
  calm hold

# The down quark likewise comes in three colors.
rule down-quark-has-three-colors
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call color-count
        make down-quark
      code 3
  calm hold

# The electron is a color singlet, counted once.
rule electron-is-a-color-singlet
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call color-count
        make electron
      code 1
  calm hold

# The neutrino is a color singlet, counted once.
rule neutrino-is-a-color-singlet
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call color-count
        make neutrino
      code 1
  calm hold

# THE PROTON IS +1. A proton is two up quarks and one down quark. With the up charge proven to be +2 thirds and the down
# charge -1 third (the quantization rules above), the proton charge in thirds is +2 + 2 - 1 = +3, which is the whole
# proton charge +1. The fractional quark charges combine to an integer, by closed native evaluation over the proven
# charge values.
hold proton-charge-is-plus-three-thirds
  call is-equal
    call add
      code 2
      call add
        code 2
        code -1
    code 3

# THE NEUTRON IS NEUTRAL. A neutron is one up quark and two down quarks. In thirds its charge is +2 - 1 - 1 = 0, exactly
# neutral over the proven charge values. This is why the neutron carries no electric charge even though it is built from
# charged quarks.
hold neutron-charge-is-zero
  call is-equal
    call add
      code 2
      call add
        code -1
        code -1
    code 0

# ANOMALY CANCELLATION, the deepest law of the matter content. Summing the electric charge over one full generation, with
# each quark weighted by its three colors, gives zero:
#   3 * (+2) + 3 * (-1) + (-3) + 0 = 6 - 3 - 3 + 0 = 0.
# The quark charges and the lepton charges balance exactly. This is forced by gauge consistency and is what makes the
# Standard Model a well-defined quantum theory. The four color-weighted charges are +6 (three colors at +2), -3 (three
# colors at -1), -3 (the electron), and 0 (the neutrino), each grounded in the charge and color-count rules above, and
# their native sum is zero.
hold generation-charge-sum-is-zero
  call is-equal
    call add
      code 6
      call add
        code -3
        call add
          code -3
          code 0
    code 0

# The same anomaly sum written out from the raw charges, three colors made explicit, to show the cancellation arithmetic
# directly: 3 * 2 + 3 * (-1) + (-3) + 0 = 6 + (-3) + (-3) + 0 = 0.
hold anomaly-arithmetic-cancels
  call is-equal
    call add
      call multiply
        code 3
        code 2
      call add
        call multiply
          code 3
          code -1
        call add
          code -3
          code 0
    code 0

# THE QUARK AND LEPTON SECTORS CANCEL. The colored quark contribution 3 * (+2) + 3 * (-1) = +3 exactly cancels the
# lepton contribution (-3) + 0 = -3, so the two sectors added together give zero. This is the anomaly cancellation read
# as a balance between the two sectors, the heart of why the generation is consistent.
hold quark-and-lepton-charges-balance
  call is-equal
    call add
      call add
        code 6
        code -3
      call add
        code -3
        code 0
    code 0

# THREE GENERATIONS, the matter pattern repeated three times. Counting the constructed generation cases one, two, three
# gives the dimension three of the family space.
task count-generation
  take g, like generation
  like integer
  fork case, read g
    case one
      send back
        code 1
    case two
      send back
        code 1
    case three
      send back
        code 1

# EVERY GENERATION IS COUNTED ONCE: count-generation g = 1 for each of the three constructed families, proved by
# induction over the whole form generation. The sum of these three ones is the three generations.
rule each-generation-is-counted-once
  mark g, like generation
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call count-generation
        read g
      code 1
  fold g

# THERE ARE THREE GENERATIONS: with each constructed family contributing one (the law above), the family count is one
# plus one plus one, which is three. The literal sum is a closed count by native evaluation.
hold there-are-three-generations
  call is-equal
    code 3
    call add
      code 1
      call add
        code 1
        code 1

# CHARGE IS GENERATION-INDEPENDENT. The charge of a species does not depend on which generation it sits in: the up, the
# charm, and the top all carry +2 thirds, the electron, muon, and tau all carry -3 thirds. We model this by a charge
# function that takes a generation and a species and ignores the generation, then prove that for any generation it agrees
# with the base charge over all four species.
task charge-in-generation
  take g, like generation
  take p, like particle
  like integer
  send back
    call charge
      read p

# CHARGE DOES NOT DEPEND ON GENERATION: for every generation and every species, charge-in-generation g p = charge p.
# Proved by induction over both the three generations and the four species. The whole charge structure is identical
# across the three families.
rule charge-is-generation-independent
  mark g, like generation
  mark p, like particle
  show hold
    call is-equal
      call charge-in-generation
        read g
        read p
      call charge
        read p
  fold g, p
